# Deployed to Compute subscription.
#
# QUICK START: define one app entry in container_apps.
# PRODUCTION: set enable_container_registry = true and push images to the ACR output.
# PRIVATE ENV: set aca_internal_load_balancer = true and add an "aca" subnet in spoke_subnets.
# =====================================================
